
                ISO 1302:2002 Geometrical Product Specifications (GPS) - Surface texture

                Surface Roughness Parameters:
                - Ra: Arithmetic mean deviation
                - Rz: Maximum height of the profile
                - Rq: Root mean square deviation

                Surface Finish Symbols:
                - Rough machining: Ra 12.5-25.0 μm
                - Fine machining: Ra 1.6-6.3 μm
                - Grinding: Ra 0.4-1.6 μm
                - Polishing: Ra 0.1-0.4 μm
                